# Contact form delivery.
#
# The form already works with no configuration: it posts to FormSubmit, which
# forwards enquiries to the address in src/content.ts (anwincorporation@gmail.com).
#
# IMPORTANT, one-time step: the very first submission after deploying triggers a
# confirmation email from FormSubmit to that inbox. Click the link in it once, or
# no enquiries will be delivered. Check spam if it does not appear.
#
# Set these only if you want to use a different service instead.

# --- Formspree (create a form, paste its endpoint) ---------------------------
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id

# --- Web3Forms (needs an access key) -----------------------------------------
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here

# Note: VITE_ prefixed values are compiled into the public JavaScript bundle and
# are readable by anyone. That is fine for form endpoints and keys, which are
# designed to be public. Never put a private API key or database credential here.
